# memory_double_free — double-free error detection
# (README §14). Tests detecting double free bugs.

MemoryDoubleFree is project
MemoryDoubleFree module examplesMemoryDoubleFree
MemoryDoubleFree target console
MemoryDoubleFree entry main

examplesMemoryDoubleFree is module
examplesMemoryDoubleFree path examples.memoryDoubleFree
examplesMemoryDoubleFree exports main
examplesMemoryDoubleFree purpose "Demonstrate double-free detection"
examplesMemoryDoubleFree invariant "Double frees are prevented"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main memory heap yes
main async no
main purpose "Detect double-free errors"
main invariant "Double-free detection works"

main let code immutable ExitCode 0
main return code
